            "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Dreams of Candlelight - Chinese style suspense decryption plot game </h2></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><br>In the late Qing Dynasty, early Republic of China.<br><br>Su Linfeng, who has just returned from studying abroad.<br>He was curious about his brother-in-law, so he looked for a family picture of her sister's marriage.<br>But found one more person in the photo ......<br>And who is that ...<br>Why do they appear in the family portrait?<br>Since my father loved her mother, why did she not mention her mother?<br>The death of his mother was a simple dystocia or ...?<br>Locked room ...<br>Hidden photos ...<br>Sixteen years ago ...<br>What happened?<br><br>--------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Introduction</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The total length of the game about 5-10 hours, a variety of outcomes reached</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>full-featured voice dubbing, allowing you to more realistic experience of emotional changes in the game</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multi-scene interactive decryption. </li></ul>",
